  "description": "Official LM Studio OpenAI-compatible local server (INPUT llm_input → OUTPUT llm_output). Default base http://127.0.0.1:1234/v1. operation selects chat (POST /chat/completions) or list_models (GET /models). Optional api_key when Developer → Server Settings requires a token. Dedicated node for discovery/list — not a replacement for shipped Local LLM chat. Customer-host only. Docs: https://lmstudio.ai/docs/developer/openai-compat. Terms: https://lmstudio.ai/app-terms. File/image use type file. Never log api_key.",
